    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Novice:</strong> When Dual Wielding, you no longer take the -10 WS penalty to defending after attacking with both weapons.</p><p><strong>Apprentice:</strong> When you Critically Hit an enemy, raise their roll on the Critical Woundsy table by +10 if striking with both weapons.</p><p><strong>Journeyman:</strong> You gain+1 SL when defending with both weapons.</p><p><strong>Master:</strong> You no longer need to hit with both weapons to gain an Advantage, with a potential gain of +2 Advantage if both strikes hit.</p>"
